{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the flow as you hunt, butcher, and cook at a blisteringly fast pace in this action shop-keeping game. Hunt adorable monsters, chop colossal carcasses, and power-slice through huge chunks of flesh to serve your customers even faster. Move fast and stay sharp if you want your shop to survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Butcher</strong> - chop the meat out of giant carcasses, and sell it for profit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698900/extras/7e894c86f8db50b8c04ef16f47bd143b.poster.avif?t=1771865019\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698900/extras/7e894c86f8db50b8c04ef16f47bd143b.webm?t=1771865019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698900/extras/7e894c86f8db50b8c04ef16f47bd143b.mp4?t=1771865019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cook</strong> - make the food exactly right for each customer, or process and sell appealing foods for the masses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698900/extras/1da2dd0af272ecbd96c94c66962ab60f.poster.avif?t=1771865019\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698900/extras/1da2dd0af272ecbd96c94c66962ab60f.webm?t=1771865019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698900/extras/1da2dd0af272ecbd96c94c66962ab60f.mp4?t=1771865019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight</strong> - slice, dice, and CHOP your enemies into delicious cuts of prime meat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698900/extras/e47a5ed4cd451c5965b2bcb20a282961.poster.avif?t=1771865019\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698900/extras/e47a5ed4cd451c5965b2bcb20a282961.webm?t=1771865019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698900/extras/e47a5ed4cd451c5965b2bcb20a282961.mp4?t=1771865019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sell</strong> - rows of customers keep on coming - stay sharp, keep one step ahead of the law, and your shop just might survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698900/extras/c215426c78559643f7de27e49fa92b52.poster.avif?t=1771865019\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698900/extras/c215426c78559643f7de27e49fa92b52.webm?t=1771865019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698900/extras/c215426c78559643f7de27e49fa92b52.mp4?t=1771865019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed an endless stream of ever-more demanding customers in endlessly unique randomized levels. Buy cooking machines, store vast amounts of food, upgrade everything, and see how long you can last!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feed your Beast</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect over 200 unique foods to feed to your friend, keep him going strong and happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Old School Tunes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth but intense 90s Boom Bap inspired soundtrack.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2698900?t=1771865019","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2698900?t=1771865019","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698900/208b1abc0ff4d64f7e9afee826fcd2f650ddb2ce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771865019","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698900/208b1abc0ff4d64f7e9afee826fcd2f650ddb2ce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771865019","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3231430,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the flow as you hunt, butcher, and cook at a blisteringly fast pace in this action shop-keeping game. Hunt adorable monsters, chop colossal carcasses, and power-slice through huge chunks of flesh to serve your customers even faster. Move fast and stay sharp if you want your shop to survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Butcher</strong> - chop the meat out of giant carcasses, and sell it for profit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698900/extras/7e894c86f8db50b8c04ef16f47bd143b.poster.avif?t=1771865019\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698900/extras/7e894c86f8db50b8c04ef16f47bd143b.webm?t=1771865019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698900/extras/7e894c86f8db50b8c04ef16f47bd143b.mp4?t=1771865019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cook</strong> - make the food exactly right for each customer, or process and sell appealing foods for the masses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698900/extras/1da2dd0af272ecbd96c94c66962ab60f.poster.avif?t=1771865019\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698900/extras/1da2dd0af272ecbd96c94c66962ab60f.webm?t=1771865019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698900/extras/1da2dd0af272ecbd96c94c66962ab60f.mp4?t=1771865019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight</strong> - slice, dice, and CHOP your enemies into delicious cuts of prime meat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698900/extras/e47a5ed4cd451c5965b2bcb20a282961.poster.avif?t=1771865019\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698900/extras/e47a5ed4cd451c5965b2bcb20a282961.webm?t=1771865019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698900/extras/e47a5ed4cd451c5965b2bcb20a282961.mp4?t=1771865019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sell</strong> - rows of customers keep on coming - stay sharp, keep one step ahead of the law, and your shop just might survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698900/extras/c215426c78559643f7de27e49fa92b52.poster.avif?t=1771865019\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698900/extras/c215426c78559643f7de27e49fa92b52.webm?t=1771865019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698900/extras/c215426c78559643f7de27e49fa92b52.mp4?t=1771865019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed an endless stream of ever-more demanding customers in endlessly unique randomized levels. Buy cooking machines, store vast amounts of food, upgrade everything, and see how long you can last!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feed your Beast</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect over 200 unique foods to feed to your friend, keep him going strong and happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Old School Tunes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth but intense 90s Boom Bap inspired soundtrack.</p>","developers":["Hermit Gamesmiths"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698900/369b23e786a9fe1259a04cbccc6ebb2dddd84f44/header.jpg?t=1771865019","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>O